     "a": "Split it into roughly 100–250 MB compressed chunks so COPY can load them in parallel. Use a suitable warehouse size and a named stage with a file format.",
     "e": "Snowflake can parallelize some large CSVs itself, but splitting upstream is still the recommended practice for predictable speed."
