     "a": "CONTINUE, SKIP_FILE, SKIP_FILE_<n>, 'SKIP_FILE_<n>%', ABORT_STATEMENT.",
     "e": "SKIP_FILE_10 skips a file with 10+ errors; 'SKIP_FILE_10%' skips it if 10% of its rows fail, giving you tolerance thresholds."
