     "q": "In the sample file, which row is rejected and why?",
     "a": "Row 5 (Hooli): 'not-a-date' can't be converted to DATE.",
     "e": "Text that isn't a date can't be converted to DATE; with ON_ERROR = 'CONTINUE' only that row is skipped."
