     "id": 220,
     "level": "B",
     "q": "What does the COPY result show for this file?",
     "a": "Status PARTIALLY_LOADED, 2 rows loaded, 1 error.",
     "e": "Example 2's two rows plus rows 3 and 4 give ORDERS four rows after this load."
