     "id": 223,
     "level": "I",
     "q": "You run the same COPY again. What happens?",
     "a": "0 rows load: the file is skipped because load metadata (kept 64 days) shows it's already loaded.",
     "e": "This protects against accidental double-loading, and it's a key reason COPY-based pipelines are safe to rerun."
